## Fix Remaining Services

Each domain event record needs getter methods added. Here's the pattern:

### Current (Broken) Event:
```java
public record SomeEvent(
    String eventId,
    String aggregateId,
    Instant occurredAt,
    String causedBy) implements DomainEvent {

    @Override
    public String getAggregateType() {
        return "SomeType";
    }

    @Override
    public String getEventVersion() {
        return "1.0";
    }
}
```

### Fixed Event:
```java
public record SomeEvent(
    String eventId,
    String aggregateId,
    Instant occurredAt,
    String causedBy) implements DomainEvent {

    @Override
    public String getEventId() {
        return eventId;
    }

    @Override
    public String getAggregateId() {
        return aggregateId;
    }

    @Override
    public String getAggregateType() {
        return "SomeType";
    }

    @Override
    public String getEventVersion() {
        return "1.0";
    }

    @Override
    public Instant getOccurredAt() {
        return occurredAt;
    }

    @Override
    public String getCausedBy() {
        return causedBy;
    }
}
